// A failed strike makes the next one bigger (WP9.3a-1, R2, docs/rules/ai.md "Escalation and the harvester threat (WP9.3a-1)"): the AI of the
// variant profile `ai_bounce_defs/normal.ron` (attack at 800 value from tick 100, escalation 500 permille capped at 3000, riflemen only) with a barracks, a refinery with one harvester
// and 1200 credits on the first match's map, against a strong static defence (six towers, six riflemen and a light tank round the construction
// centre). The first wave fails, and the next launch needs more than the value of the one that failed.
// No scripted command. `unit_defs` names a FROZEN copy (ai_bounce_defs, made for WP9.3a-1): the shipped definitions of 14-11-2026, the profile above and
// a match file of its own. The ore, harvest, storage, money, production, power and vision numbers are those of `ai_raid_guard`.
Scenario(
    name: "ai_bounce",
    seed: 0xA1_BA5E,
    map: (width: 96, height: 96),
    map_name: Some("m1"),
    unit_defs: Some("ai_bounce_defs"),
    match_file: Some("match.ron"),
    ai: [(player: 0, profile: "normal.ron", seed: 0xA1_0001)],
    buildings: true,
    combat: true,
    targeting: true,
    destruction: true,
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 2000), (43, 1500)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1)),
    production: Some((queue_limit: 5, exit_radius: 4, build_speed: (3, 2))),
    power: Some((shortage_floor_permille: 250, defence_cutoff_permille: 1000)),
    vision: Some((legacy_sight_milli: 5000, acquire_needs_sight: true)),
    ticks: 21000,
    commands: [],
